#EXTM3U
# IPTVMax — App Review test playlist
#
# Openly licensed material only. The Blender Foundation open movies are CC-BY;
# the HLS entries are public test streams published by their owners for exactly
# this purpose. Nothing here is a provider's catalogue and nothing here needs
# credentials.
#
# Shaped to fill all three tabs of the app, which is what makes it worth
# reviewing with: entries whose URL contains /live/ are read as channels, names
# in SxxExx form are read as episodes of a series, and everything else is a
# film. See M3UParser.classify.
#
# Hosted at https://texassoftwarehub-dev.github.io/review.m3u (LinkSite/), the URL
# in the App Review notes in AppStoreListing.md.

